			"Message": "chore(Output): Minify build configuration and remove source maps for release\n\nCompress the ESBuild configuration and plugin pipeline in the Output element to reduce module size and evaluation time. Replace verbose variable bindings (e.g., `Prefix` -> `t`, `Editor_default` -> `r`) and collapse function bodies in entry point definitions (`Configuration/ESBuild/CodeEditorLand/Editor.js`, `Microsoft/VSCode.js`) and exclusion rules (`Configuration/ESBuild/Exclude/*`).\n\nSimultaneously, delete all `.js.map` source map files associated with these configuration modules. This follows the previous readability pass, reverting the codebase to a production-ready state where logical behavior is preserved but source formatting is collapsed. The build pipeline entry points, exclusion patterns for Electron/Node/Telemetry, and plugin transform logic remain functionally identical.",
